#: src/qml/settings/SettingsSoul.qml
msgctxt "@title"
msgid "Soul"
msgstr "Soul"

msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Define the AI's personality, tone, and behavior rules. This content is sent "
"as the system message with every conversation."
msgstr "定义 AI 的性格、语气和行为规则。每次对话时都会把它作为系统消息发送。"

msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Humanizer is enabled. Instructions for more human-like responses will be "
"appended to your Soul content when sending messages."
msgstr "已启用人性化。发送消息时，会把让回复更像真人的说明追加到 Soul 内容中。"

msgctxt "@info:placeholder"
msgid ""
"You are a helpful, concise assistant.\n"
"\n"
"Rules:\n"
"- Be direct and clear\n"
"- Use simple language\n"
"- Ask for clarification when unsure"
msgstr ""
"你是一个乐于助人、简洁明了的助手。\n"
"\n"
"规则：\n"
"- 直接、清晰\n"
"- 使用简单的语言\n"
"- 不确定时先请求澄清"

