msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Configure remote MCP (Model Context Protocol) servers to give AI models "
"access to external tools via Streamable HTTP."
msgstr ""
"配置远程 MCP（模型上下文协议）服务器，让 AI 模型可以通过 Streamable HTTP "
"调用外部工具。"

